---

<section class="text-center py-20 bg-light-bg dark:bg-dark-bg">
  <h1 class="text-5xl font-bold text-light-text dark:text-dark-text">
    Facundo Pidal
  </h1>
  <p
    class="mt-4 text-lg text-light-secondary dark:text-dark-secondary max-w-2xl mx-auto text-balance"
  >
    Soy un desarrollador full-stack apasionado por crear aplicaciones y sitios
    web que no solo sean visualmente atractivos, sino también intuitivos y
    funcionales para el usuario. Disfruto de transformar ideas en soluciones
    digitales eficientes y bien diseñadas.
  </p>
  <div class="mt-8 flex justify-center gap-4">
    <a
      href="mailto:facundopidalruizdiaz@gmail.com"
      class="flex items-center justify-center w-12 h-12 bg-light-accent text-light-bg dark:bg-dark-accent dark:text-dark-bg rounded-full hover:opacity-90"
    >
      <svg
        xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
        class="h-6 w-6"
        fill="none"
        viewBox="0 0 24 24"
        stroke="currentColor"
      >
        <path
          stroke-linecap="round"
          stroke-linejoin="round"
          stroke-width="2"
          d="M3 8l7.89 5.26a2 2 0 002.22 0L21 8M5 19h14a2 2 0 002-2V7a2 2 0 00-2-2H5a2 2 0 00-2 2v10a2 2 0 002 2z"
        ></path>
      </svg>
    </a>
    <a
      href="https://github.com/facundopidal"
      target="_blank"
      rel="noopener noreferrer"
      class="flex items-center justify-center w-12 h-12 bg-light-accent text-light-bg dark:bg-dark-accent dark:text-dark-bg rounded-full hover:opacity-90"
    >
      <img
        src="/icons/github-mark.svg"
        alt="GitHub"
        class="h-6 w-6 invert dark:invert-0"
      />
    </a>
    <a
      href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/facundopidal/"
      target="_blank"
      rel="noopener noreferrer"
      class="flex items-center justify-center w-12 h-12 bg-light-accent text-light-bg dark:bg-dark-accent dark:text-dark-bg rounded-full hover:opacity-90"
    >
      <img
        src="/icons/linkedin.png"
        alt="LinkedIn"
        class="h-6 w-6 invert dark:invert-0"
      />
    </a>
  </div>
</section>
